{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"前沿推荐技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-task-learning","title":"推荐系统多任务学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/multi-task-learning","wordCount":1361,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"llm-based-recommendation","title":"LLM 驱动的推荐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/llm-based-recommendation","wordCount":1423,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"fairness-exploration","title":"推荐系统公平性与探索-利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/fairness-exploration","wordCount":1572,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 前沿推荐技术\n\n本章覆盖 2024-2026 年推荐系统领域最活跃的前沿方向。多任务学习让单一模型同时优化点击率、转化率等多个业务目标；LLM 驱动的推荐将大语言模型的语义推理能力引入推荐决策；公平性与探索-利用平衡则关注推荐系统的社会责任与长期健康。\n\n这三个方向代表了推荐系统从单纯追求准确率向多目标、可解释、负责任演进的趋势。每个方向都已有头部公司的大规模线上验证，但仍处于快速迭代中。\n"}